# AKL scoping filter (gitignore-spec, merged with .gitignore by graphify).
# Keeps the substrate spine free of vendored/minified/generated noise.
# Evidence this matters for fin: chart.min.js alone = ~1433 junk AST nodes
# (cited in claude-workflow-system/design-architecture-knowledge-layer.md).

# Vendored / minified
*.min.js
*.min.css
chart.min.js
static/chart.min.js

# Design prototypes (not production code)
mockup-*.html

# Generated / data artifacts
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*_backup.db
demos/

# Tests (Python tree)
tests/
test_*.py
*_test.py

# One-off migration / backfill scripts (not part of the app surface)
backfill_*.py
migrate_*.py
repair_*.py
seed_mock_data.py
